# um-texts 1
=== MODIFIER a1
Extra Area
Doubles the spell's initial coverage area.
A+

=== MODIFIER a2
Ultra Area
Triples the area covered by the spell.
A++

=== MODIFIER d1
Extra Duration
Doubles the spell's duration.
D+

=== MODIFIER d2
Ultra Duration
Triples the spell's duration.
D++

=== MODIFIER e1
Extra Effect
Doubles the spell's effect.
E+

=== MODIFIER e2
Ultra Effect
Triples the spell's effect.
E++

=== MODIFIER fe
Enemy Filter
The spell will only affect the Magician's enemies.
:En

=== MODIFIER ff
Friend Filter
The spell will only affect the Magician's allies.
:Fr

=== MODIFIER fg
Goblin Filter
The spell will only affect Goblins.
:Go

=== MODIFIER fh
Human Filter
The spell will only affect humans.
:Hu

=== MODIFIER fl
Lizard Filter
The spell will only affect Lizards.
:Dr

=== MODIFIER fo
Orc Filter
The spell will only affect Orcs.
:Or

=== MODIFIER ic
Item: Continuous
You can insert the spell into an object and it will be cast continuously, as long as the object has enough energy.
Ic

=== MODIFIER im1
Item: Extra Energy
Decreases the amount of energy used by the inserted spell.
P-

=== MODIFIER im2
Item: Ultra Energy
Significantly decreases the amount of energy used by the inserted spell.
P--

=== MODIFIER ir1
Item: Extra Regeneration
Speeds up energy regeneration in the object carrying this spell.
G+

=== MODIFIER ir2
Item: Ultra Regeneration
Significantly speeds up energy regeneration in the object carrying this spell.
G++

=== MODIFIER it
Item: Trigger
You can insert the spell into an object. The spell will be triggered when the object is used or struck.
It

=== MODIFIER m1
Extra Energy
Decreases the amount of stamina used when casting the spell.
M-

=== MODIFIER m2
Ultra Energy
Significantly decreases the amount of stamina used when casting the spell.
M--

=== MODIFIER r1
Extra Range
Doubles the spell's range.
R+

=== MODIFIER r2
Ultra Range
Triples the spell's range.
R++

=== MODIFIER t1
Extra Targets
The spell will also affect another target nearby.
T+

=== MODIFIER t2
Ultra Targets
The spell will also affect two other targets nearby.
T++

